<title>FRANCE: Renault says will appeal French ruling.</title>
<headline>Renault says will appeal French ruling.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Automaker Renault said on Friday it would appeal against a French court ruling barring it from carrying out a procedure for closing its Vilvoorde plant in Belgium until it fulfilled obligations to consult its European works council.</p>
<p>&quot;Renault will appeal the judgment,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Renault awaits the result of this appeal with confidence,&quot; it added.</p>
</text>
